WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:28.000
I. Before an encounter
A quiet question is heard through witness E.

00:28.000 --> 00:48.000
The view widens to seven unwritten vessels.

00:48.000 --> 01:36.000
II. A voice enters
Connections appear. Only source B receives writing contacts.

01:36.000 --> 02:24.000
III. What passes between
The outer circle joins. Gestures travel through reciprocal wave bridges.

02:24.000 --> 03:12.000
IV. An exchange
Other vessels retain inscriptions from the encounter.

03:12.000 --> 03:48.000
The camera approaches the altered centre.

03:48.000 --> 04:02.000
V. The source leaves
Connections fade to zero. B departs from the composition.

04:02.000 --> 04:08.000
Transient motion and feedback are cleared.
Inscription and wear remain.

04:08.000 --> 04:32.000
VI. The returning question
The same five-note question returns. E's recorded answer is unchanged.

04:32.000 --> 04:48.000
The view and listening widen.
A, C and G carry different answers.
